  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the BioBricks licensing-provenance annotation agent (Claude, slice items[786:792]). The Harmonizome site terms explicitly state the data are 'Free for academic, non-profit use under the CC BY NC SA 4.0 License' and that commercial use requires a separate license from Mount Sinai Innovation Partners. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 is non-commercial + share-alike => classed restricted; commercial use is prohibited without a Mount Sinai license. HUMAN REVIEW: Harmonizome aggregates >100 upstream databases, several of which (e.g. COSMIC, KEGG, TRANSFAC) carry their own additional non-commercial or license-required terms, so even a Mount Sinai commercial license would not necessarily clear every component.",
